    sampleBody: 'As Project Manager at [Company], I manage a portfolio of 4 simultaneous projects totalling ₹45Cr, overseeing cross-functional teams of 8–22 people across Engineering, Finance, IT, and Operations. I hold PMP certification and use a hybrid Agile-waterfall methodology adapted to project type. For the ERP implementation above, I facilitated a 3-month stakeholder alignment process involving 14 business owners and the CEO, managed a vendor team of 22, and maintained a risk register with 47 identified risks — 3 of which would have caused 8+ week delays if not mitigated proactively.',
