    sampleOpening: 'I reduced cold launch time on [Company]\'s consumer app from 2.4 seconds to 1.0 second through lazy view initialisation and asynchronous image loading, helping lift our App Store rating from 4.0 to 4.6 — the kind of measurable iOS craftsmanship I want to bring to [Target Company]\'s app.',
    sampleBody: 'As iOS Engineer at [Company], I built and maintained features for our consumer app (1.2M downloads, 4.6-star App Store rating) using Swift with SwiftUI for new screens and UIKit for legacy flow maintenance, structured in MVVM with Combine for reactive data binding. I integrated Core Data for offline-first local persistence and built a Core ML-based image classification feature for a product-scanning flow that shipped to 200,000 users in its first month. I write XCTest unit tests for view models and business logic, maintaining 72% coverage, and run XCUITest suites for critical checkout flows in our GitHub Actions pipeline before every TestFlight build. I have shipped 10 App Store releases via Fastlane and App Store Connect over the past year, each maintaining a 99.5%+ crash-free session rate.',
