    sampleOpening: 'As a B.Pharm graduate registered with the [State] Pharmacy Council since 2021, I have dispensed over 150 prescriptions daily at a high-volume retail outlet while maintaining zero dispensing errors over three years — the kind of accuracy and patient care standard I want to bring to [Target Company]\'s pharmacy team.',
    sampleBody: 'At [Previous Company], I managed prescription dispensing for a high-footfall retail pharmacy outlet, handling an average of 150+ prescriptions daily, including Schedule H and H1 drugs requiring careful verification and record-keeping, while providing medication counselling on dosage and interactions to walk-in patients. I managed inventory for a store carrying over 2,000 SKUs, running monthly ABC analysis to prioritise fast-moving stock, and reduced expiry-related wastage by 30% through a revised indent and stock-rotation process. I maintained accurate records for adverse drug reaction reporting as part of the outlet\'s pharmacovigilance obligations, and trained two new pharmacy assistants on dispensing protocol and Schedule H/X compliance. I am comfortable with pharmacy management software for prescription and inventory tracking, and I hold a valid registration with the [State] Pharmacy Council.',
