    sampleBody: 'At [Previous Company], I built and maintained a customer-facing dashboard used by 60,000 monthly active users, using React 18 with TypeScript, Redux Toolkit for global state, and React Query for server-state caching, structured entirely with functional components and hooks. I led the migration of our marketing site from Create React App to Next.js, implementing SSG for static pages and ISR for frequently updated content, which improved our Lighthouse performance score from 61 to 94 and Largest Contentful Paint by 55%. I wrote Jest and React Testing Library tests for our shared component library, reaching 80% coverage, and set up Cypress end-to-end tests for our checkout flow that caught two regressions before release. I also contributed to our internal Storybook-based design system, improving component reuse across three product teams and reducing new-feature UI development time by roughly 20%.',
