    sampleOpening: 'I achieved 124% of my monthly sales target for eight consecutive months at [Company], onboarding 35 new retail outlets across a South Bengaluru territory — the kind of consistent, target-driven performance I want to bring to [Target Company]\'s sales team.',
    sampleBody: 'At [Previous Company], I managed a field sales territory covering 120 retail outlets across South Bengaluru, consistently achieving 110–124% of my monthly sales target over eight consecutive months by combining structured beat planning with proactive outlet-level relationship management. I onboarded 35 new retail outlets in the territory, growing overall territory revenue by 22% year-over-year, and maintained a 92% repeat order rate among existing accounts through regular stock and scheme follow-ups. I used Zoho CRM to track outlet-level order history and scheme redemption, and prepared weekly MIS reports that helped my regional manager identify two underperforming sub-territories for intervention. I also trained two new sales trainees on beat planning and outlet negotiation during my final quarter.',
